// title: List all Cloud Permissions of a Compromised User · Sentinel
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender XDR
// tables: ExposureGraphEdges
// purpose: List all Cloud Permissions of a Compromised User · Sentinel
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/DFIR/ExposureManagement%20-%20CloudPermissionsUser.md
// kind: repo
